    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "今天上完课后，我在教室里等妈妈来接我。",
      "traditional": "今天上完課後，我在教室裡等媽媽來接我。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān shàng wán kè hòu wǒ zài jiào shì lǐ děng mā ma lái jiē wǒ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "我今天考试得了第一，我想马上告诉她这件事情。",
      "traditional": "我今天考試得了第一，我想馬上告訴她這件事情。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ jīn tiān kǎo shì dé le dì yī wǒ xiǎng mǎ shàng gào su tā zhè jiàn shì qing",
      "english": "Today after finishing class, I was sitting in the classroom waiting for my mom to come pick me up."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "可是等了好久，妈妈都没有来。",
      "traditional": "可是等了好久，媽媽都沒有來。",
      "pinyin": "kě shì děng le hǎo jiǔ mā ma dōu méi yǒu lái",
      "english": "I got the highest score on the exam today, and I wanted to tell her about it as soon as possible."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "后来是姐姐来接了我回家，她说：“妈妈今天工作太忙，忘了时间。”",
      "traditional": "後來是姐姐來接了我回家，她說：“媽媽今天工作太忙，忘了時間。”",
      "pinyin": "hòu lái shì jiě jie lái jiē le wǒ huí jiā tā shuō mā ma jīn tiān gōng zuò tài máng wàng le shí jiān",
      "english": "But no matter how long I waited, my mom didn't come."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "我虽然有点儿伤心，但是也很心疼妈妈。",
      "traditional": "我雖然有點兒傷心，但是也很心疼媽媽。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ suī rán yǒu diǎn'r shāng xīn dàn shì yě hěn xīn téng mā ma",
      "english": "Finally my sister came instead, and she said \"Mom was very busy at work today, and forgot the time\"."
    }
  ],
