    "sentence_translations": [
      "Diary - After School",
      "",
      "Tuesday 2015-03-31. Sunny",
      "",
      "Today after finishing class, I was sitting in the classroom waiting for my mom to come pick me up.",
      "I got the highest score on the exam today, and I wanted to tell her about it as soon as possible.",
      "But no matter how long I waited, my mom didn't come.",
      "Finally my sister came instead, and she said \"Mom was very busy at work today, and forgot the time\".",
      "Even though I was a bit hurt, I also felt bad for my mom."
    ]
